            <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> [add date]</p>

            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Chat Media Cleaner</strong> (“the app”)
                handles user information. The app is designed with privacy as a core principle and
                operates entirely on the user’s device.
            </p>

            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>The app does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or transmit any personal data.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>No names, phone numbers, contacts, or account information</li>
                <li>No messages, chats, or conversation content</li>
                <li>No location data</li>
                <li>No device identifiers or advertising IDs</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Local File Access</h2>
            <p>
                The app accesses media files stored on your device (such as images, videos, audio,
                and documents) solely to:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Display file information (name, size, date)</li>
                <li>Allow users to review and manually delete selected files</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                All file processing happens <strong>locally on your device</strong>.
                No file data is uploaded, shared, or transmitted.
            </p>

            <h2>Permissions</h2>
            <p>
                The app requests storage access permissions only to scan and manage media files
                selected by the user. These permissions are used strictly for the app’s core
                functionality.
            </p>

            <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>The app does not:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Share data with third parties</li>
                <li>Use analytics SDKs</li>
                <li>Use advertising SDKs</li>
                <li>Send data to remote servers</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Internet Usage</h2>
            <p>
                The app does not require an internet connection. All features work fully offline.
            </p>

            <h2>Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                Because no personal data is collected or transmitted, there is no external storage
                of user data. All actions remain under the user’s control on their own device.
            </p>

            <h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                The app does not collect personal information from users of any age and complies
                with applicable child privacy regulations.
            </p>

            <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                This Privacy Policy may be updated if the app’s functionality changes. Any updates
                will be reflected on this page.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact</h2>
